      <uighur>kirilekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хирлэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>KIRILE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and i. To act to the best of one's ability; to determine the place or time; to fix the price, appraise, evaluate; to be moderate.</definition>
      <page>472</page>
      <examples>
